    "text": "Kuna\nKuna lavender farm owners are ready to turn over a new leaf, entering their last season of operations\n2 hours ago\nKUNA, Idaho — A popular Treasure Valley lavender farm that draws hundreds of visitors each season is up for sale as its owners decide to focus on their growing family. The Timm family, who operates Vista Farms on 40 acres in Kuna, announced they are putting their property on the market.\n1",
